#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi\\_modal.embed"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:1 of
msgid "Embed multimodal input with a multimodal embedding model."
msgstr "使用多模态 embedding 模型对多模态输入生成 embedding。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:3 of
msgid "Input data used to render one embedding request per row."
msgstr "用于按行渲染 embedding 请求的输入数据。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:5 of
msgid "Multimodal embedding model instance."
msgstr "多模态 embedding 模型实例。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:7 of
msgid ""
"Multimodal input template. Values may contain placeholders that reference"
" columns in ``data``. The template is rendered row by row and sent as a "
"single multimodal embedding input for that row."
msgstr ""
"多模态输入模板。值可以包含引用 ``data`` 中列的占位符。模板会逐行渲染，并"
"作为该行的一条多模态 embedding 输入发送。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:11 of
msgid ""
"Whether to return embedding vectors directly when supported by the model "
"executor, instead of the raw provider response."
msgstr ""
"当模型 executor 支持时，是否直接返回 embedding 向量，而不是原始 provider "
"响应。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:14 of
msgid "Additional embedding parameters."
msgstr "额外 embedding 参数。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed:17 of
msgid ""
"A DataFrame with ``response`` and ``success`` columns. Failed requests "
"store the error message in ``response``."
msgstr ""
"包含 ``response`` 和 ``success`` 列的 DataFrame。失败请求会将错误信息写入"
" ``response``。"

#: maxframe.learn.contrib.llm.multi_modal.embed of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

